   "publish_at": "2026-11-11T10:00:00+05:30",
   "keyword": null,
   "pillar": 3,
   "topic": "Client offboarding: notice in writing, sign-off, separate final invoice, handover pack, testimonial after payment",
   "sources": [
    "https://soloopsguide.com/workflows/client-offboarding-workflow-for-freelancers-and-solo-service-businesses/",
    "https://postnitro.ai/blog/post/instagram-carousel-design",
    "https://creatorflow.so/blog/instagram-carousel-structure/"
   ],
   "caption": "Fire clients. Keep the bridge. Save this for the day you need it.\n\nGhosting feels easier. It also kills the referral and the testimonial you earned.\n\nThe clean exit:\n1. Give notice in writing, with the last day named\n2. Finish or close open work and get sign-off in writing (silence isn't a yes)\n3. Send the final invoice as its own email\n4. Hand over logins, files, the posting schedule and a 1-page how-to\n5. Ask for a testimonial only after the invoice is paid\n\nKeep the notice to dates and deliverables. Vent to your friends, not the client.\n\nSend this to a freelancer stuck with a client they've outgrown.\n\n#freelancelife #socialmediamanager #agencylife #clientmanagement #freelancetips #creatorbusiness",
   "spec": {
    "id": "2026-11-11-c1",
    "keyword": null,
    "seam": true,
    "cover": {
     "style": "poster",
     "theme": "lilac",
     "series": "AGENCY LIFE · OFFBOARDING",
     "kicker": "SAVE THIS",
     "title": "Fire clients. *Keep* the bridge.",
     "sub": "The 5-step clean exit.",
     "scene": {
      "set": "studio",
      "cam": "wide",
      "action": "wave",
      "props": [],
      "sets": {
       "studio": {
        "laptop": {
         "title": "notice.txt",
         "lines": [
          "Last day: 30th",
          "Handover: ready"
         ]
        }
       }
      }
     }
    },
    "slides": [
     {
      "type": "flag",
      "n": "",
      "label": "DON'T DO THIS",
      "title": "The *ghost* exit",
      "says_label": "YOU THINK",
      "says": "I'll just slowly stop replying.",
      "fix_label": "INSTEAD",
      "fix": "Ghosting burns the referral too. A clean exit is 5 steps, done over a couple of weeks."
     },
     {
      "type": "timeline",
      "tag": "THE CLEAN EXIT",
      "title": "Your exit *plan*",
      "items": [
       {
        "when": "DAY 1",
        "title": "Give notice in *writing*",
        "body": "Use your contract's notice period. Name the last day."
       },
       {
        "when": "WEEK 1",
        "title": "Close open work",
        "body": "Get sign-off in writing. Silence isn't a yes."
       },
       {
        "when": "LAST DAY",
        "title": "Send the *final invoice*",
        "body": "Its own email. Closing work and closing money are two jobs."
       },
       {
        "when": "LAST DAY",
        "title": "Hand over everything",
        "body": "Logins, files, schedule, a 1-page how-to."
       },
       {
        "when": "PAID",
        "title": "Ask for a *testimonial*",
        "body": "Only after the invoice clears."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "chat",
      "label": "COPY THIS",
      "n": "",
      "title": "The *notice* message",
      "who": "Client",
      "status": "online",
      "msgs": [
       {
        "from": "them",
        "text": "Can we plan next month's content?"
       },
       {
        "from": "you",
        "text": "Before we plan: I'm wrapping up our work on the 30th. I'll finish this month and hand over everything."
       }
      ],
      "note": "A date, what's finished, what they get. No blame, no essay."
     },
     {
      "type": "doc",
      "tag": "SCREENSHOT THIS",
      "title": "The *handover* pack",
      "head": "HANDOVER · LAST DAY",
      "meta": "Example list · adapt it to your client",
      "lines": [
       {
        "k": "Logins",
        "v": "Your access removed, passwords reset by them",
        "n": "1"
       },
       {
        "k": "Files",
        "v": "Raw + final files in one shared folder",
        "n": "2"
       },
       {
        "k": "Schedule",
        "v": "Posts queued up to the last day",
        "n": "3"
       },
       {
        "k": "How-to",
        "v": "1 page: tools, timings, what worked",
        "n": "4"
       },
       {
        "k": "Contacts",
        "v": "Editors and tools you used",
        "n": "5"
       }
      ],
      "foot": "A good handover is the referral you get later."
     },
     {
      "type": "flag",
      "n": "",
      "label": "ALSO DON'T",
      "title": "The *rage* exit",
      "says_label": "YOU WANT TO SAY",
      "says": "Working with you has been a nightmare.",
      "fix_label": "SAY THIS",
      "fix": "Even if it was: dates and deliverables only. Vent to your friends, not in the client's inbox."
     },
     {
      "type": "recap",
      "tag": "SCREENSHOT THIS",
      "title": "Clean exit *cheat sheet*",
      "items": [
       "Notice in *writing*",
       "Sign-off, not *silence*",
       "Invoice = its *own email*",
       "Testimonial *after payment*"
      ]
     },
     {
