   "caption": "\"Just don't work with our competitors.\" That line is worth money. Save this before you sign.\n\nExclusive means saying no to other paid deals, so it gets its own fee on top of your content fee. One 2026 pricing guide suggests, for category exclusivity:\n• 30 days: +20–35%\n• 90 days: +50–75%\n• 12 months: +100–150%\n• No other brands at all, 30 days: +50–80%\n\nBefore you sign, write down:\n1. The category (name the competitor brands)\n2. The end date\n3. A short after-window (aim for 30 days)\n\nThese are one guide's ranges, not rules. Not legal advice.\n\nSend this to the friend who said yes to \"exclusive\" for free.\n\n#branddeals #creatorbusiness #influencertips #ugccreator #contentcreator #creatoreconomy",
