   "caption": "Comment IDEA and I'll DM you the free Reel Idea Machine (a Claude skill + PDF guide) to fill your calendar.\n\nA folder of 42 screenshots is not a content plan.\n\nByte fixes · EP 8: Claude Sheets just launched in beta (paid plans, Nov 10). It builds spreadsheets with tabs, formulas, formatting and drop-downs from a prompt.\n\n1. Ask: \"Make a 30-day Instagram content calendar. Columns: date, pillar, hook, format, status.\"\n2. Add: \"Make status a drop-down: idea / filmed / posted. Add a tab that counts posts by pillar.\"\n3. Use it: every time you post, flip the status.\n\nTonight you don't scroll your screenshots. You check the sheet and film what it says.\n\n#claudeai #aitools #contentcalendar #contentcreator #creatortips #aiforcreators",
